Root cause:
The bug was caused by the failure to deregister and free fixed-link PHY devices when the probe function encountered errors or when the driver was unbound. This oversight could lead to memory leaks and resource management issues, as the fixed-link PHY resources were not properly released, resulting in potential instability or crashes in the system.
